{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1296,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0899e5843be332d79b36f9f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "リスクを恐れず行こう！\r\n挑戦とはそういうものだろう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "87e27d45217edd2c6e005bbb1a315c5c2ac9eb2be1b3d726cda324093449df07",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92216"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e0bfba158ea41fcdcfad7e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究の目標が見つかると、\r\n冷静ではいられなくてねぇ。\r\n体が結果を求めてやまないよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "181ffc42fccb2557835baba2010c3e3c4a64e61b8bdd926e9099680f8f5ace3d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92217"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26e9512da43ac186cb891d5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "それでは実験を始めようか。\r\n私の可能性を引き出す、\r\n新たなる試みを！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d0999e73a8dba7d2190ed679aef203a1789160b4dff5ee7dab6d394b1cc5f89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92218"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eaf6a9ed1f40bc17687c88b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可能性は信じていたよ…昔からね。\r\nもっとも、実感できるように\r\nなったのは最近だけれど…フフ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fa8916dfbdb3b0ee6a19ce9e6901bacd3a6bfa8629b3cc4abead33994c8ba89",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92220"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e1e5f792aa4dfa58eb894ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "多くを学び、あらゆる分野の知見\r\nを得た…が、研究は終わらない。\r\nむしろ、項目が増えたくらいさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "416e1c9e71b6b59bd2ab60a09bc0bd64cee0db0af7e3e7db6e283f2a10c4373b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f88766ce9bdba772fe78a81f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "進めど進めど学びは尽きないねぇ！\r\n最高だ！どこまでも私は進んでいけ\r\nる！行こう、知識の最果てへ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d1f957450685068bb0e41867a0687666347c655cb463d9cae6e7f45ad4ea2ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "92222"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82951d023d25cf357f71e4b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你的存在给我带来了很多可能性哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fd833088ef33eeb3893bd4ee8203c85ceaad14a325341151fa2e84358fd6abf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da64eb516e1485ff5f25d624",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目标虽然还很遥远，但可能性已经足够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d06c5a21ccb48540194f24295e7f89f7b76d0178d9e7c362b08001040d8572f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:934c693214dadb5f1a4c30ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这种感觉会令人上瘾，对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c29764e176d8c1303b26bedc97540dada8f702286182b81d84de5c210a320083",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f74ea08cea2de7f0650d165e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啦，接下来要以哪里为目标呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a345ad4a3f4c663ee2e7b7723b49a69aac1d2b76ca800ef60165d329edcde046",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d292f07c1fd72a6339fed029",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "共同研究だからこその成果だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3151fba8a238c1047464055216a3b56cf4d0f2017d334bc973d31d70a4166420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "93204"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33d41df1a5cd20858ba45a4c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成果を次なる研究に繋げるとしよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de07b6d60330c2bba807e5316b04b326f04daab3ccecea72b145c6be92174310",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "93205"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3aba5e566751ffef4bd2c69d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀，变得有趣起来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d211d1c0f7a6770d54adbac600d5d194c673ad37d770af8f14d74cefc90df7a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f805901fab793ad6b4812f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是可能性哦，训练员君！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41ba1a28892b316306de471994a817df7061558aa2d55f98bf1a86009d50655e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5e5c83cd58d3ae09a77b13d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是爱丽速子。需要我帮忙吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce2c810f8a0225c65d2320ce34cee37d4413709f98ccb67d4c2433969888faf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88dc2a24a55dd672b27535cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "桀桀…支援就交给我吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd49553565fe5b441c15c60adf44834d9986af8301b4cddf38ac89b639a3b58f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:361fbad3d8e6d9b56d5c5ec1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "离可能性又近了一步呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff6e52e67d91fde2e5865fe9418cb840c584bb4566e15635442ac0156ef60aa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40711d3f109a2390f7c95ffa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉渐渐止渴了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb288110d8220072f324e67efd3c70676721879753032a91e0cb35fa2328bbc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddc407993e48cc87f23ae7e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊啊，我感觉到进化了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d198ddffeebdee5755a00a9c5db0bdffbb9a00d538b11eb12bce90499bfcf1a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9c366129b70ee92e2208190",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我们来探索吧！\r\n探索那未知世界的深层──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a411814d96129ca1efd005985b711ce6bd4b6da44a3ddb33136daff68eec285",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c2a3817f69173fe870284032",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是爱丽速子。\r\n要不要跟我一起潜向未知呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7cf395d7ab009bdec173a56c0b82f587a1a7cd7a4be24fe8e55e09f6a1a5f693",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:422facd5912aa1f75f77f12d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "研究がはかどるねぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bf1003dd363779c90fefd8d80c765194dc47013f2bcf8de6bc0b6d46a107e6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95207"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7675e5d0e4e57793e1dbaeac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やはり、限界ではなかったか！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0698f913e241aabb9184c8d646e65b1c2a1b58a469694480e9890cb6dc86cd8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95208"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7ed15275bb1ca3b25895783",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私自身の可能性――\r\n実証する時が来たようだね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1825f6dc3f07957e8383d8f5993b1b13ad54d95fccf88157aa88b4d2d182cb8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95209"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f1dc9f88b01ff3f947874e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アグネスタキオン。\r\n研究の成果、お見せしよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "085864aa2bda4004c22107f7424bdfe9215f828080a262091235f5fc385d8513",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1032",
        "95210"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:278a5cfe578c7425c3e402cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……到我出场了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaaa46034bee807d6805f99aa9201d489fe785311edd88bd622751b2d670f11c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:927ca0ec1167d6054d14916c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……你也是，其他人也是。\n就算被我拒绝，也硬要站到我身边……\n……真是……死脑筋……",
      "source_fingerprint": "15035a8e3d5f301b64442c4888b170b4876671fed1bfd933980b17ea4bf0af5d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37093704eba15b593c70dd5a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e42824481b89139758cebcbc6de379bc2bfe391af6bc5931ce02cac1bdb2432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95df2f034f6750b963ad84ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻ったわ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf827c54f95b1f850341efaf81405e47789d9dccd5fbb863697661afb1fa7b06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d0d00cbfa471f07bc252094",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…就算对你说不用管我，\r\n也是徒劳吧？\r\n这点事情我还是明白的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92f2df63e9e4659bf3727c0b9502301261a871f8bdc01ef4d992d1be71791cac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b33c10932fb96d23bf065c94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天文馆似乎新增了不少适合入门者的项目。\n只是说一声而已……\n要是你还有兴趣的话，可以去去。",
      "source_fingerprint": "222de97e29f067c96713d2b0ad684ae2b7b1737855d3dc4b3f9fb83b64c356d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef75aa20eb2429cd839270e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……新年我也不会休息的。\n给弟弟们的压岁钱已经提前给妈妈了，\n她会替我转交，没关系。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27ce9b0dd742445916ee6211a442e3c755fe722ab54c6a9c69bdaa8b523da075",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2abbc298b072b5f2bd678ff0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给你的巧克力放你桌上了。\n要吃掉还是丢掉随你便。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2324d4aa4e1fea2c4aa5a52ab647e0c14ee245f6054884269f170a001dc4ce5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82d2b7e6dddf2b59ddaec7e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不用给巧克力的回礼。\n我只是报答你的恩情而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "167cb9afabb4b2e04ef990677e7e2cbf246cb6218966b79573d7f489ae3a4625",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e3faaaeb8e986a0ede301f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "天琴座也有『七夕之子』的意思。\n……没什么，只是杂学知识而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f2727577c72544c8ce8ad3ec5d0bb03a698d68811da902742070ba5607ea0ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dda547c0c3977c2aceffe224",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我觉得你不会这样……\n但你可别说那些陈词滥调哦？\n又不是小孩子了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a3e8d5bf90c90cf850670f3af0b01d9e55b1196591da60e5f1a71819c3c19f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9ba04cc6d66516ec8194cbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这段时间到处都是彩灯啊……\n明明只要有星光就好了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "48259a97e1d785c47e0bf9dd46fa43c15266bf9736ffa13f3f8fd3f0d273c6df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d62c613d84bb590c5e9c5105",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……圣诞快乐。\n我倒也没在高兴，只是顺应潮流而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3881a0b4a783be609ea9af2e88c43e70ee4df52aba2435fbaefb56aa0c1e6d69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1dda54f18db61eb67ff5fe2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e83aa0ebedbafc894362e5d9b45b0cb4ab939fe816a08aef341ea714cebcabe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:974a5721076d8215e3bd622a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年要到了。\n只要再过一天……\n今年也将成为历史了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ac4c313500a310b2498d94615df6021c9addb2fa567c68c12c44a50a7725952",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9b75cf392490697cd8fdc6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说起来，今天是你的生日吧。\n生日快乐……怎么了？\n你是我的担当训练员，记住你的生日很正常吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "480707655b2622ac3c4d7ae744c7c5b531f141df0377d5ad4807c5309dd34f6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4fc46feb40aa7270603141f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "既然是生日，休息一天怎么样？\n……你也多在意下自己的身体比较好哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ce82ef247c5ffb68cab6c19970fd3fd9f60f215bc1deffe3e75fd1ff05d51a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ceb45c0a17c05fefc5dd73a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……生日快乐什么的，不用特意祝贺。\n对你而言，这只是普通的一天吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57b6919d765b20e503025411ac57a19925eed7a226461ef91142cceff78669df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f595b279ec2b50316200d0c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这并非我一人的生日，所以不用特意道贺。\n如果要祝贺的话……祈祷就好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8751f7bc2bbe2c779b4d843b0280223a9e4eb572b33c0bf6fff894043d2db8d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5fc38f24c3469fda6a674a1d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新的通知。\n要去看看吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9deadabfa5fcd7fe247a56afe81e2630008699bac3454ffdb7563273706ccaf2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ced01d6928bf9b98485ea133",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了。\n……怕忘记的话，在冰箱上贴上便签吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cf2e20526d008cd436eaa08f6966bbaeba504ebb436708c8562ee45d20f4136",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a224e11897c7d62e214894e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务完成，辛苦了。\n………………\n我泡了茶。要喝吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e01eb052b7ac4e146bf1ef13c6805bfea73445a64dddb4831ee15531abb93fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:945cd9a3d82f1639d5627c09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说活动就要开始了。\n……班上的同学们都特别兴奋。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4675b370f7d0ec5d86a126c208a4a745d741b23bb435bdd30ae50aa4b3bd21da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:566e6172c7369856af472792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动进行中。\n要怎么参加……交给你了。\n看上去你挺习惯参加活动的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96249494aa85b602ca0d6b604a876d412334614eee787f6eca547f465ace8905",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf9203116062272ab5b3394",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……竟会落得如此下场……",
      "source_fingerprint": "665b6288926a0ddb193727d4f47fd373ae9e1a07399caff5b4b54956622131a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df775b55265bd419e8d205e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名鉴等级好像上升了。\n手纲小姐在到处找你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "792d82ceba3b2d4556c6f0f642c27e09422f7f04d05f931d594b544091f5b25c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c78453c5cf8fa5e7a9968b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没有什么特别的讲究。只要能动就行了……剩下的，只要有最基本的、舒服的触感就够了……就这样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "119f1a73b83ba2aa921d22065621e10553de19326fc4e4c5c563ee87b9c28a1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b61c932017c8056ab53e9d4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿便服的时候，机伶小姐经常会来抱我……我也明白触感很好……但还是希望她能适可而止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71392362488743016598428831fbf163a89bcb80ff4e1d9e09285142525e71bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f6e579321dc90ad5e4e9102",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果要在晚上外出……还是多穿点比较好。夜里会很冷。尤其是深夜，星星最容易看见的时候……",
      "source_fingerprint": "17b20b138f86bf4307a27723bf4780b5a95c6dc20e7d4a5be129ca432e052ea1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f89324751ebd5cb187420b70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "996cd512db679cfd8c7583b98310bcfd71ddca0c2cf220557dfae39c75e06410",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20dbbaaf59343fb32b93e4d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……胜利呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f8b9fd3b2edd6a39232683a20b03ec7f4a939eb3fd625ec6aa10c27d498783e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5074b95513d265a677fa7bfa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……竟会落得如此下场……",
      "source_fingerprint": "665b6288926a0ddb193727d4f47fd373ae9e1a07399caff5b4b54956622131a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8cc287fc85064432a2b78250",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……唔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "996cd512db679cfd8c7583b98310bcfd71ddca0c2cf220557dfae39c75e06410",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca53fc01cf78910a0ebe0948",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "记录更新了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2bb606e8c60399bd152367b0c26c57dc7ebe8cee11a548c968021e03838e4f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98168b9e4a9aae181bfaa4d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eb0d881cd80a16baae5d41c1d7268ab2194b50e1175597b0547df0c45d47e02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55be2666cac2f783af97f91c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……吵死了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a5deaf6f5ad0445c8b69917f5c340df73ac7fbf29092123e783103e26bfaa79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04f361b4b21626f21add13dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……赢了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7203509e5d1cffd8c96a4cecf7f74fbe88d9a8b415077c38c30517e58249ffc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78533b0a7930f155a7bd5a2c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你也很想获胜吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8505b457501f2efed84ec45d55a89ca0faa79737771378e337df89fa3d75b2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31003753c15f37a7bc1a9ca2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别、别这么亲近！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4655b9a12592c4933bb2f432d00c3e37ec0362e1b051ffaec0bfdbcbe1ad32c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:661244695773f5396005ce2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1911b58c42852b91202976b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在开始训练之前，\n先把训练内容排得紧凑一些吧。\n时间是有限的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f2ab6f6aff3529c35bde1d50eb2dd4e585d057596af436fd570e0907789f01c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:044a1ed3f06c13176c189b0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……历史是由人们的行为\n编织而成的。随着时间的流逝，\n历史的沉淀也会越多。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f3ea2c70709c485986633ea57a9b2af4e694a95f35b121f0ffe69f35c99a8e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6027be93dd50214e4b41d577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要参加比赛吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd047d140114c5885cbc7dea47b3f01f7f4864dd4f569c105bbefd11228d4dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77fb69b345d0bd07d3db5b58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……也是呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b891daa63fb13fb40330a8dd7d98fb3f25a443b6a7462760268934230655395d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "1177"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b81d8d03d494305bb1e7f35",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dbc6076addce5db2afc25ac3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……身体……好温暖……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad75a403f003aaf07b628cb4aab947815e99ce1cc40d110fe4d4275e0304a063",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65dc58e59be353113ae0d55a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看来这是今天的登录奖励。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0650746cd287bfb87fbedb9db83c1428611676fe494b912b513b042c258d383",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1033",
        "13"
      ]
    },
